    <description>F: New Quote screen flow launched from the Opportunity New Quote action. Pre-fills the same fields as the old create-record quick action (Name, Quote Type, Target Site, Contract Term, RDD) from the Opportunity, creates the Quote, then redirects the user to the new Quote record. Replaces the Opportunity.New_Quote create-record quick action.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>formula_QuoteName</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;Quote - &quot; &amp; {!var_opp.Name} &amp; &quot; - v1&quot;</expression>
    </formulas>
